  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of the AU-EU D4D Hub Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The African Union &#x2013; European Union (AU-EU) Digital for Development (D4D) Hub aims to strengthen Africa&#x2019;s capability to seize digitalisation opportunities for inclusive and sustainable development. The project provides demand-driven technical assistance to national and regional institutions, promotes knowledge sharing, and facilitates dialogue.    The AU-EU D4D Hub is a flagship Team Europe project, co-funded by the European Union and five Member States. Enabel coordinates the implementation of the project in partnership with seven European organisations.    The AU-EU D4D Hub is part of the D4D Hub, a EU-led platform that creates and leverages partnerships to shape a sustainable digital future worldwide.</narrative>
  </description>
